  "entry": "main.py",
  "files": [
    {
      "name": "main.py",
      "starter": "starter-main.{lang}.py",
      "solution": "solution-main.py"
    }
  ],
  "timeout_sec": 30,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "`class Note(BaseModel):` iki alan; `@app.post(\"/notes\", status_code=201)`; `{\"id\": len(notes), **note.model_dump()}`.",
      "en": "`class Note(BaseModel):` two fields; `@app.post(\"/notes\", status_code=201)`; `{\"id\": len(notes), **note.model_dump()}`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n**main.py**\n\n```python\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\nfrom pydantic import BaseModel\n\napp = FastAPI()\nnotes = []\n\n\nclass Note(BaseModel):\n    text: str\n    pinned: bool = False\n\n\n@app.post(\"/notes\", status_code=201)\ndef add_note(note: Note):\n    notes.append(note)\n    return {\"id\": len(notes), **note.model_dump()}\n\n\n@app.get(\"/notes\")\ndef list_notes():\n    return notes\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n**main.py**\n\n```python\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\nfrom pydantic import BaseModel\n\napp = FastAPI()\nnotes = []\n\n\nclass Note(BaseModel):\n    text: str\n    pinned: bool = False\n\n\n@app.post(\"/notes\", status_code=201)\ndef add_note(note: Note):\n    notes.append(note)\n    return {\"id\": len(notes), **note.model_dump()}\n\n\n@app.get(\"/notes\")\ndef list_notes():\n    return notes\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "http",
      "steps": [
        {
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/notes",
          "json": {
            "text": "buy milk"
          },
          "expect": {
            "status": 201,
            "json": {
              "id": 1,
              "text": "buy milk",
              "pinned": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/notes",
          "json": {
            "text": "call mom",
            "pinned": true
          },
          "expect": {
            "status": 201,
            "json": {
              "id": 2,
              "text": "call mom",
              "pinned": true
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/notes",
          "json": {
            "pinned": true
          },
          "expect": {
            "status": 422
          }
        },
        {
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/notes",
          "expect": {
            "status": 200,
            "json": [
              {
                "text": "buy milk",
                "pinned": false
              },
              {
                "text": "call mom",
                "pinned": true
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
